    <field name="scopecontent_teim">Series III contains correspondence, most of which was written to Foreman by her mother, Gladys Foreman. In addition to personal correspondence, a small portion of this series pertains to Foreman&#39;s art, writing and teaching.</field>
    <field name="scopecontent_teim">This series is arranged chronologically, with an emphasis on preserving Foreman&#39;s original arrangement. Because original arrangement was the main processing concern, there are small chronological overlaps from folder to folder (e.g. a folder dated &#34;1986-89&#34; may be followed by one dated &#34;1987-88&#34;). There is no chronological overlap between boxes in the series.</field>
